note as BIZ_diagram_48_automation
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  A governed layer that lets multiple AI agents (and deterministic bots) automate the
  capture, enrichment, validation and routing of information records across the platform —
  the "dynamic multi-agent automation layer" the clients asked for. Registers agents with
  versioned definitions, the tools they may call, and the guardrails/policies that bound
  them; orchestrates work through triggers -> workflows -> tasks -> agent runs -> steps,
  with per-record automations, human-in-the-loop approvals, agent memory/knowledge and a
  full append-only execution trail. Every automated write is attributable and auditable.
end note

